  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NESA Center Combating Transnational Threats Senior Executive Seminar 01-24: Technological Innovation and Security Challenges in the NESA Region&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTSES 02-23 Theme: Countering Narratives of Extremist Organizations: Managing Disinformation&quot;: The dangers posed by violent extremist organizations are noted throughout the world. Various measures have been taken by nations in the NESA region to combat them when possible. However, such organizations continue to adapt and use technological advances, new media platforms, and now areas of operation to their advantage. What means are commonly used? Where do they innovate? And, most important to the professionals in this seminar: how do we collectively counter them? What narratives must be employed to challenge the information presented by violent extremist groups in their efforts to recruit new members of infiltrate societies and communities in our countries?</narrative>
  </description>
